    {
      "title": "North Korean Hackers Stole Billions, the F.B.I. Says. It’s Not Their First Heist.",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/31/world/asia/north-korea-hacking.html",
      "description": "This week’s $6.3 billion hack of Binance is the largest to hit crypto, and would be the most that North Koreans have stolen in years of brazen cybercrime.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-10-31T23:05:42"
